+**Hair texture**, on the same super-admin panel, defaults to **Keep natural**. The reference prompt keeps the texture from the selfie and uses Image 2 for the cut only. Straight, Wavy, or Curly is sent only when that select is changed. If the catalogue JPEG is a different texture and no `{id}-curly.jpg` (or wavy, or straight) sibling exists, the page warns and still sends the shipped JPEG. No current reference is curly. `beach-waves` and `soft-waves` are wavy. The rest are straight.
